      "message": "I guess ASSERT is what we want. It makes me a bit nervous that ASSERT can be disabled: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/e99a90eadd9e22069c7764ed7ca98a312373a5aa/include/config.h#1443.\n\nI suppose we could add something like this in the file:\n\n  #if !defined(CONFIG_DEBUG_ASSERT) || !defined(CONFIG_DEBUG_ASSERT_REBOOT)\n  #error \"Expected assertions to be enabled\"\n  #endif",
